<title>THAILAND: Bkk Bank of Commerce rises 10 pct limit.</title>
<headline>Bkk Bank of Commerce rises 10 pct limit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors rushed to buy stocks of ailing Bangkok Bank of Commerce in early trade on Monday pushing the stock up its daily limit of 10 percent.</p>
<p>The stock moved up rapidly after the market opened and held steady at 6.80 baht, up 0.60, at 0416 GMT.</p>
</text>
